==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|enthron|ing}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To put on the throne in a formal installation ceremony called ''[[enthronement]]'', equivalent to (and often combined with) [[coronation]] and/or other ceremonies of [[investiture]]
# {{context|transitive|figuratively|lang=en}} To help a candidate to the succession of a monarchy (as a kingmaker does), or by extension in any other major organisation.

